{"t_ms": 18622750, "conversation_id": "conv_immediate_s4_048", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["EV Charging Station\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nElectric vehicle charging stations are available within the hotel's parking area. Guests may use the charging facility based on availability. Charging fees are calculated according to electricity consumption and are payable during check-out. Guests should contact the Front Desk to reserve a charging slot if required.", "Parking Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nOn-site parking is available for hotel guests at a charge of \u20b9200 per vehicle per day. Parking spaces are allocated on a first-come, first-served basis and cannot be reserved in advance. Guests are requested to lock their vehicles and avoid leaving valuable belongings inside parked cars.", "Taxi & Local Transport Booking\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Concierge Desk can arrange taxis, airport transfers, car rentals, and local sightseeing transportation. Guests are encouraged to book transportation in advance during weekends and holidays. Fare estimates will be provided before confirming the reservation, and payment can be made directly to the service provider or added to the room bill where applicable."], "scores": [0.47141700983047485, 0.829790472984314, 0.8637057542800903], "filenames": ["48_ev_charging.txt", "60_parking_v2.txt", "49_taxi_booking.txt"], "timing_policy": "immediate", "timing_trigger": "immediate", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 32, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
